+# Prepared resolution source snapshot
+
+The base distribution is nab-provider 0.0.26. The patch selects `_compat.py`, `preference.py`, `preference_provider.py`, `prepared_resolution.py`, `value.py`, `version_candidates.py` and `py.typed` from `nab-provider/src/nab_provider` at signed Nab commit `f5550702cb034e8908ce45d463d1ab6006bb2d34` (tree `408328524c3e75b0120d8df8d7ddbe5b60992a24`), based on main `3a92b9ad22a15d12f563608864d004145984b312`. The resolver uses the same source commit.
+
+Pip retains native acquisition, declarations, source policy and installation. The provider subset owns candidate identities, prepared dependency encoding, live-release trials, withdrawal admission and scoped preference proofs. It uses a minimal initializer and Pip's packaging namespace. The index-backed provider, universal resolution and private packaging copy are excluded. The original license files are retained.
+
+The prototype APIs are not released in 0.0.26. The matching resolver is recorded in `nab_resolver/PROVENANCE.md`.
